     1,
     "Hi,\r<br>\r<br>I use color to denote the classes. So the labels (e.g., 2seater) on\r<br>the x axis are not needed. Does anybody know a way to remove the\r<br>labels? Thanks!\r<br>\r<br>qplot(class,hwy,data=mpg,geom=&#39;boxplot&#39;, color=class)\r<br>\r<br>--\r<br>Regards,\r<br>Peng\r<br>"
    ]
   ]
